    "benefits": {
      "type": "section-double",
      "blocks": {
        "h1": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Supports Healthier-Looking Hair",
            "heading_font_size": "heading-small",
            "padding_bottom": 8,
            "heading_tag": "automatic"
          }
        },
        "t1": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Gentle scalp massage helps stimulate circulation, supporting a healthy environment for stronger, healthier-looking hair. It also helps distribute the scalp’s natural oils from root to tip for softer, shinier hair.</p>",
            "text_font_size": "body-medium",
            "padding_bottom": 28
          }
        },
        "h2": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Rooted in Traditional Kansa",
            "heading_font_size": "heading-small",
            "padding_bottom": 8,
            "heading_tag": "automatic"
          }
        },
        "t2": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Handcrafted from Kansa, a traditional blend of copper and tin used for centuries in Indian wellness rituals. In Ayurveda, Kansa is traditionally valued for its grounding qualities and connection to balance and restoration.</p>",
            "text_font_size": "body-medium",
            "padding_bottom": 28
          }
        },
        "h3": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Releases Built-Up Tension",
            "heading_font_size": "heading-small",
            "padding_bottom": 8,
            "heading_tag": "automatic"
          }
        },
        "t3": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Slow massage across the scalp, temples and neck helps release built-up tension and encourage a sense of calm. Traditionally, these areas are associated with marma points — vital energy points used in Ayurvedic practices.</p>",
            "text_font_size": "body-medium",
            "padding_bottom": 28
          }
        },
        "h4": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Elevates Your Hair Ritual",
            "heading_font_size": "heading-small",
            "padding_bottom": 8,
            "heading_tag": "automatic"
          }
        },
        "t4": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Use the Kansa Scalp Comb alone or pair it with SEVA Hair Strengthening Oil to help distribute oil evenly through the scalp and lengths. A simple ritual that brings intention, care and a moment of calm to your routine.</p>",
            "text_font_size": "body-medium",
            "padding_bottom": 0
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "h1",
        "t1",
        "h2",
        "t2",
        "h3",
        "t3",
        "h4",
        "t4"
      ],
