    "visible_results": {
      "type": "section-visible-results",
      "blocks": {
        "review_dxLyf4": {
          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Untitled_1580_x_1080_px.png",
            "rating": 5,
            "quote": "<p>The Seva hair oil has been a complete game changer for my post partum hair. As a busy mum of four it can be hard to find the time for self care, but this has been an easy routine I could implement at home without needing to go into a salon. The oil has reduced my hair loss when washing, while at the same time helped to regrow, thicken and strengthen my hair, plus it smells amazing! I would highly recommend for any new mums suffering from hair shedding to help bring growth and moisture back to your hair.</p>",
            "name": "Sophie"
          }
        },
        "r1": {
          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-14_at_10.54.26_3.jpg",
            "rating": 5,
            "quote": "<p>SEVA Hair Oil has genuinely exceeded all of my expectations! My hair started falling out almost immediately after having my baby & within just eight weeks of using this oil, I’ve already noticed so much new growth along my hairline. My hair feels healthier, stronger & looks shinier than it has in a long time. Definitely a 5 star product from me!</p>",
            "name": "Caitlyn Muir"
          }
        },
        "r2": {
          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Untitled_design_6.png",
            "rating": 5,
            "quote": "<p>As a guy, I wasn’t looking for a complicated hair routine. After 17 weeks of using Seva Hair Oil, my hair looks fuller, healthier, and stronger. It’s simple to use, easy to stick with, and I’m really happy with the results.</p>",
            "name": "Shyam"
          }
        },
        "r3": {
          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Side_by_side_example.png",
            "rating": 5,
            "quote": "<p>My daughter’s hair had been falling out quite a lot and was feeling stressed from her weekly chlorine swimming lessons. With used the oil consistently on her hair for the past 8 weeks and have noticed such a difference. Her hair looks healthier, feels stronger and we’re seeing much less fallout.</p>",
            "name": "Elayna"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "review_dxLyf4",
        "r1",
        "r2",
        "r3"
      ],
